{"id":"2180959879","kind":"answer","title":"如何培养出自驱型学习的孩子？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2021-10-21","updated":"2021-10-21","votes":19,"comment_count":5,"minutes":1,"chars":253,"keywords":["学习动机","外在动机","内在动机","奖励机制","教学设计"],"summary":"首先，学习是孩子的天性，可以给孩子带来快乐。 普通人怎么才会像打游戏一样爱上学习？ 不要弄巧成拙，打着为了培养孩子自驱学习的名义，来强迫、哄骗孩子学习。 我怎样才能外在地激励孩子? 如果真的想要帮助孩子，那我推荐阅读这篇文章： 11 最佳推动区 图 ： 最佳推动区 （蓝色）是可能改进学习效果的外部压力范围。如果压力超过推动区…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/483938762/answer/2180959879","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"jumfwhTc\">首先，学习是孩子的天性，可以给孩子带来快乐。</p><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/answer/1578551193\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">普通人怎么才会像打游戏一样爱上学习？</a><p data-pid=\"YmGs6WKY\">不要弄巧成拙，打着为了培养孩子自驱学习的名义，来强迫、哄骗孩子学习。</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-entity-data=\"null\" data-entity-type=\"article\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c93ea384e2e900e49d665878ef643a0d_720w.jpg\" data-tm-id=\"357893386\" href=\"#/post/357893386\">我怎样才能外在地激励孩子?</a><p data-pid=\"Knfycynw\">如果真的想要帮助孩子，那我推荐阅读这篇文章：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-entity-data=\"null\" data-entity-type=\"article\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-45f2677fa85e998018fda43b2ee1d774_720w.jpg\" data-tm-id=\"67694020\" href=\"#/post/67694020\">11 最佳推动区</a><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8edc961dcaf8052ee26e55abd866d126_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-cb42ff6dff92f6346afc478faaba51f9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cb42ff6dff92f6346afc478faaba51f9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"800\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8edc961dcaf8052ee26e55abd866d126_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-cb42ff6dff92f6346afc478faaba51f9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-cb42ff6dff92f6346afc478faaba51f9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"800\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"NjcjUPSt\"><b>图</b>：<b>最佳推动区</b>（蓝色）是可能改进学习效果的外部压力范围。如果压力超过推动区，学习效果就会下降。在某一点上，压力会导致学得更少，而不是更多（黑色的<b>倒退区</b>）。学校教育通过习得性无助（绿色）提高孩子对强迫的容忍度。它还会降低学习效果，并增加所需的强迫水平。</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"357893386","title":"我怎样才能外在地激励孩子?","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":28,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"67694020","title":"11 最佳推动区","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":18,"reason":"本回答Level 2 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"583003405","title":"学习的外在动机","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":55,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"1941989096428898139","title":"内在动机：深度解析","author":"Frazer Mawson","votes":239,"minutes":44,"reason":"延伸深读 · Frazer Mawson"},{"id":"448382399","title":"教育计划往往会自我颠覆","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":31,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"447958900","title":"内驱调节的学习是自我实现的；外驱调节的学习是自我否定的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":44,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"620721614","title":"表扬如何毁掉学习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":197,"minutes":22,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3537892014","title":"使用奖励和激励机制来鼓励孩子有哪些利弊端？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":41,"minutes":10,"reason":"相似问答 · 41 赞同"},{"id":"3226806639","title":"如何让孩子爱上学习，自己主动学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":133,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 133 赞同"},{"id":"19319161575","title":"教师如何激发学生主动学习的内驱力？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":93,"minutes":6,"reason":"相似问答 · 93 赞同"},{"id":"1945050547863418471","title":"孩子普娃，没有学习动力，总是一直要盯着才能去完成任务。怎么培养孩子的自驱力啊？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":131,"minutes":45,"reason":"相似问答 · 131 赞同"},{"id":"2596351300","title":"如何帮助孩子爱上学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","